# Formello motion

One motion language — reuse constants from `script.js`; do not invent parallel durations.

| Constant | Value | Use |
|----------|-------|-----|
| `FADE_MS` | `220` | Lang swap, form ↔ success crossfade |
| `MODAL_MS` | `240` | Modal open / close |

Shared fade: opacity + `translateY(4px)`, `0.22s ease`.

Always honor `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` (skip timed fades; disable listed CSS transitions).

Do not add springs, bounce, or long staggered delays. On modal close: unlock scroll and restore focus.

Details: skill **formello-patterns** → `references/motion.md`.
